@startuml
title To register a Publisher in the system

actor Administrator
participant ":System" as System

' Human contact between Administrator and UI
activate Administrator
    Administrator -> System : **1** I want to register a Publisher in the system

    activate System
    System -->> Administrator : **2** Provide name, VAT number and contact for the Publisher
    Administrator -> System : **3** For the new Publisher, here's the name, VAT number and contact information
    System -->> Administrator : **4** Publisher has been registered in the system
    deactivate System

deactivate Administrator
@enduml